        "\n",
        "### Checking the Assumptions of Linear Regression\n",
        "\n",
        "Now that the model is trained, we check whether it actually satisfies the assumptions Linear\n",
        "Regression relies on. We check these **after** training because every diagnostic below is computed\n",
        "from the model's own residuals (actual minus predicted, on the training data) — there is nothing to\n",
        "check until the model exists.\n",
        "\n",
        "For each assumption, we note the diagnostic used, the range of values it can possibly take, and the\n",
        "range considered acceptable."
      ],
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Get the model's residuals on the training data (actual - predicted).\n",
        "# Every assumption check below is based on these residuals.\n",
        "\n",
        "y_mpg_train_pred = mpg_model.predict(X_mpg_train_scaled)\n",
        "residuals_train = y_mpg_train - y_mpg_train_pred\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Residuals computed for\", len(residuals_train), \"training rows.\")"
      ],
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": 20,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
